  28:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\BFTM0.c ****   * @brief  BFTM0定时器比较值计算
  29:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\BFTM0.c ****   * @note   BFTM（Basic Free-running Timer）是一个32位自由运行定时器
  30:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\BFTM0.c ****   *         当计数器达到比较值时，会产生中断并自动清零计数器
  31:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\BFTM0.c ****   *         计算公式：比较值 = 系统时钟频率 / 期望中断频率
  32:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\BFTM0.c ****   *         此处配置为1ms中断一次：SystemCoreClock * 1/1000
  33:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\BFTM0.c ****   *         例如：SystemCoreClock = 48MHz，则比较值 = 48000
  34:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\BFTM0.c ****   */
  35:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\BFTM0.c **** #define BFTM0_TIMER_BASE            ((long long)SystemCoreClock * 1/1000)
  36:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\BFTM0.c **** 
  37:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\BFTM0.c **** //-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
