  41:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\BFTM0.c ****   *         在main主循环中用于判断是否达到指定时间间隔
  42:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\BFTM0.c ****   *         volatile关键字确保编译器不优化此变量，保证中断和主循环之间的�
  43:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\BFTM0.c ****   */
